###### ORDERS ######
### customerId opsional; bila diisi HARUS ada di customers (404 "Customer not found with id: N").
### Invoice standalone untuk order member membawa snapshot customerId + customerName dari profil.
### Create - invalid (exceeds max selection of a modifier type)
### Temperature (modifier type 1) has maxSelection = 1, so picking both hot(1) and ice(2) must be rejected.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 1 },
                { "modifierOptionId": 2 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}


### Create - invalid (modifier option not attached to the menu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 999 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Create - invalid (DINE_IN hanya boleh via POST /dinings/{id}/orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "type": "DINE_IN",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Create - invalid (type wajib diisi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Create (TAKEAWAY) — invoice standalone otomatis terbit via event
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Asep",
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "notes": "Less sugar please",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                {  "modifierOptionId": 6 },
                {  "modifierOptionId": 2 },
                {  "modifierOptionId": 13 },
                {  "modifierOptionId": 12 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Create - invalid: customerId tidak ada di customers (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 9999,
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Mark confirm (validasi status flow via OrderStatusFlowPolicy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark preparing
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark ready
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark cancel — invoice standalone unpaid ikut di-void via OrderCancelledEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?keyword=BUDI&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Update (PUT) — `type` WAJIB dikirim (@NotNull).
### Invoice OPEN unpaid ikut tersinkron (OrderItemsChangedEvent → rekonsiliasi baris invoice).
### Item & modifier IDs dipertahankan: echo id dari response GET agar row lama di-update in place.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Budi Santoso",
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "notes": "No ice",
    "items": [
        {
            "id": 4,
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 3,
            "modifiers": [
                { "id": 4, "modifierOptionId": 2 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}


### Update (PUT) - add a new line (no id -> inserted with new id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Siapa ajaa...",
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "notes": "No ice",
    "items": [
        {
            "id": 4,
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 3,
            "modifiers": [
                { "id": 4, "modifierOptionId": 2 }
            ]
        },
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 1 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Update (PUT) - invalid: mengubah type order DINE_IN (400)
### Order dine-in dibuat via POST /dinings/{id}/orders; type-nya immutable.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Update (PUT) - invalid: order sudah punya pembayaran (400)
### Invoice dengan paidAmount > 0 = frozen (tidak ada jalur koreksi di sistem).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Patch - notes only (tanpa items/type) — masih diizinkan walau invoice sudah dibayar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "notes": "Take away"
}

### Patch - items (preserve item/modifier ids) — sync invoice, ditolak 400 jika ada applied payment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "id": 1, "modifierOptionId": 1 },
                { "id": 2, "modifierOptionId": 3 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Patch - type saja (TAKEAWAY → DINE_IN tidak boleh via endpoint ini; DINE_IN hanya via dining)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "TAKEAWAY"
}


### Delete — soft delete; invoice standalone unpaid ikut di-void via OrderDeletedEvent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete - invalid: order sudah punya pembayaran (400, "already has an applied payment")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
